OL,3,GNEWSARiver walk plaque found on city
OL,4,Alitter pick
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plaque marking the 1883 creation of a
OL,7,Fcity riverwalk has been found beneath
OL,8,Fovergrown ivy.
OL,10,FVolunteers from Durham City Riverscape
OL,11,FCommunity made the discovery on a wall
OL,12,Fnear Elvet Bridge during a litter pick
OL,13,Flast weekend.
OL,15,FGroup co-founder Adam Shanley said
OL,16,Funearthing the plaque had been
OL,17,F"incredible" and the name of the walk,
OL,18,Fwhich is on it, was news to the
OL,19,Fvolunteers.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
